(lang dune 3.17)

; This file exists only to pin dune's root to this directory (the (lang ...)
; line has to come first — dune rejects a leading comment). Without it dune
; walks up to the OUTERMOST enclosing dune-project, which breaks any checkout
; nested inside another one — notably the worktrees under .claude/worktrees/*,
; where every build fails with "Don't know about directory .claude/worktrees/…"
; because dot-directories are excluded from the build. That also leaves
; ocamllsp with no merlin config for the file being edited, so cross-file
; references and diagnostics silently stop working in those checkouts.
